# Variant unit202311 of boards/hy300-t08: the first owner's unit (issue #7, GitHub `smj-0712`, 31.10./01.11.2026):
# boot package of 2023-11 (U-Boot 2023-11-18, ARISC 2023-11-23, its own device tree 7db0a4d3...) under the
# 2024-07 Android 11 userland; vendor partition, display data and DRAM block are the OTA's. Read after
# ../../board.env; a key here wins.
VARIANT=unit202311
# nothing of ours has run on it: TEST images only, over FEL first. The owner has no UART and no remote; the
# power button is the only key on the case, so a test image is reached over Wi-Fi (an AIC8801) or not at all.
STATUS=profile-only
VERIFIED_BY=
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300-t08-unit202311
# the clock of his boot0 at LBA 16 (the OTA's block; his LBA 256 copy is the HY350's 792 MHz block and does not run)
DRAM_CLK=640
